{
  "title": "Fix Kit Designs Toggle Deselection Race Condition",
  "status": "closed",
  "prompt": "Fix the Kit designs toggle in the sketchpad not removing kind=designs from the URL when clicked a second time, due to React Router BrowserRouter using startTransition by default, causing stale search params in toggleKind closure.",
  "summary": "Fixed Kit designs toggle deselection by adding unstable_useTransitions={false} to BrowserRouter and MemoryRouter in Sketchpad.tsx. Root cause: React Router 7 wraps history listener state updates in React.startTransition by default, causing useSearchParams to return stale values when a second click fires before the transition commits. Setting unstable_useTransitions={false} makes navigation state updates synchronous, ensuring the component re-renders with fresh state between clicks.",
  "github": {
    "issue": "https://github.com/usalu/semio/issues/500"
  },
